Things I learned: 
- VLOOKUP 
-PIVOT TABLE

Steps I took: 
1. clean up data with TRIM 
2. use VALUE or paste to copy values to another cell 
3. use SUM to calculate total hours per worker 
4. use PRODUCT to take the product or could have use * instead 
5. use VLOOKUP to took the hourly pay for each worker from another sheet 
  VLOOKUP for a value on another sheet: VLOOKUP(B2, Sheet2!$A$2:$F$6, 4, false) 
  VLOOKUP for a value on the same sheet: VLOOKUP(B2, A2:F6, 9, false) 
